      "ogTitle": "The Bank of the Republic — Two Thousand Pesos, Corte…",
      "ogDescription": "Banknotes of Two Thousand Pesos de The Bank of the Republic, Colombia (2005, 2009), con off-center cutting error. Colección privada Notofilia.",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/2000-pesos-off-center-cut-error/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Bank of the Republic — Two Thousand Pesos, Corte Descentrado\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Colombia catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Off-Center Cutting Error &middot; Bogotá, Colombia &middot; 2005 and 2009</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">The Bank of the Republic</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Two Thousand Pesos &middot; Portrait of Francisco de Paula Santander</p>\n        </div>\n<div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n<button data-zoom-trigger=\"2005\"\n                aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote: Two Thousand Pesos · 7 de marzo de 2005\"\n                style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado-2005-640.webp 640w, /uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado-2005.webp 564w\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado-2005.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Two Thousand Pesos de The Bank of the Republic, Colombia, fechado March 7, 2005, obverse arriba con el portrait of Santander y reverse abajo, mostrando un corte diagonal descentrado que recorta las esquinas de forma asimétrica\"\n                    width=\"564\"\n                    height=\"687\"\n                    loading=\"eager\"\n                    decoding=\"async\"\n                    style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n                <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n                  <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n              </button>\n              <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) &mdash; Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n</div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 24px;\">\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.7; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Two circulated copies of Dos Mil Pesos, dated 2005 and 2009, document guillotine cutting errors that displace the printed design with respect to the paper &mdash; in each case with a different pattern, proof that this type of failure could be repeated, with variations, in different production batches.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n\n          \n            <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin-bottom:40px;\">\n              <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center;\">Two Thousand Pesos · March 7, 2005</span>\n\n              \n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; margin-top:8px;\">\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Two Thousand Pesos</span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bogotá, March 7, 2005</span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Numbering</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">23960849</span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Error Description</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Diagonal cut, with an asymmetrical corner clip on both faces and a butterfly error</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n\n              \n            </div>\n          \n\n            <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin-bottom:40px;\">\n              <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center;\">Two Thousand Pesos · August 19, 2009</span>\n\n              <button data-zoom-trigger=\"2009\"\n                aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote: Two Thousand Pesos · 19 de agosto de 2009\"\n                style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado.webp 640w, /uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado.webp 564w\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote of Two Thousand Pesos de The Bank of the Republic, Colombia, obverse arriba con el portrait of Santander y reverse abajo, mostrando un off-center cut que desplaza el diseño impreso hacia un borde del papel\"\n                    width=\"564\"\n                    height=\"606\"\n                    loading=\"eager\"\n                    decoding=\"async\"\n                    style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n                <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n                  <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n              </button>\n              <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) &mdash; Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; margin-top:8px;\">\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Two Thousand Pesos</span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bogotá, August 19, 2009</span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Numbering</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">88646801</span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Error Description</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Corte horizontal descentrado, margen izquierdo ensanchado y borde derecho recortado</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n\n              \n            </div>\n          \n\n        </div>\n\n        \n          <div data-zoom-dialog=\"2005\" hidden role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Banknote ampliado: Two Thousand Pesos · March 7, 2005\" class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n            <button\n              data-zoom-close\n              aria-label=\"Close\"\n              style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n            >&times;</button>\n\n            <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n              <button\n                disabled=\"true\"\n                data-zoom-out aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&minus;</button>\n              <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\" data-zoom-percent>100%</span>\n              <button\n                disabled=\"false\"\n                data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&#43;</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div\n              style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n            >\n              <picture>\n                <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado-2005.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                <img data-zoom-image\n                  src=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado-2005.jpg\"\n                  alt=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n                  draggable=\"false\"\n                  style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                />\n              </picture>\n            </div>\n\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n          </div>\n        \n\n          <div data-zoom-dialog=\"2009\" hidden role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Banknote ampliado: Two Thousand Pesos · August 19, 2009\" class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n            <button\n              data-zoom-close\n              aria-label=\"Close\"\n              style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n            >&times;</button>\n\n            <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n              <button\n                disabled=\"true\"\n                data-zoom-out aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&minus;</button>\n              <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\" data-zoom-percent>100%</span>\n              <button\n                disabled=\"false\"\n                data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&#43;</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div\n              style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n            >\n              <picture>\n                <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                <img data-zoom-image\n                  src=\"/uploads/colombia-2000-pesos-error-corte-descentrado.jpg\"\n                  alt=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n                  draggable=\"false\"\n                  style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                />\n              </picture>\n            </div>\n\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n          </div>\n        \n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Banknote Design</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Both bills correspond to the Two Thousand Pesos edition with the portrait of Francisco de Paula Santander on the obverse, printed by the Banknote Printing Office of the Banco de la República in predominantly green and beige colors, with the Bogotá Mint reproduced on the reverse.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">The Off-Center Cutting Error</h2>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\">When separating banknotes from a printing sheet, the guillotine must precisely follow the cutting lines provided by the design. In the 2009 copy, the cut was made horizontally: the left edge of the obverse is noticeably wider than normal, while the right edge cuts off part of the denomination &ldquo;2000&rdquo; and the portrait. In the 2005 issue, the displacement was diagonal, leaving both bills &mdash; obverse and reverse &mdash; with an angular cut that trims the corners asymmetrically.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\">This type of defect is known among collectors as<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">&ldquo;off-center cut&rdquo;</strong>, one of the cutting error variants that, together with the &ldquo;butterfly&rdquo; error (excess paper attached) and the fold, are part of the classic guillotining failures in banknote production.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Legacy for Collectors</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Off-center cut banknotes directly show a margin of paper that is normally trimmed and discarded &mdash;a rare window into the physical process of making paper money, which rarely survives intact in a circulated specimen. Having two examples from different years allows us to compare how the direction and magnitude of the displacement varies from one batch to another.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Pick, Albert.<em>Standard Catalog of World Paper Money.</em></li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions —<a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Bank of the Republic —<a href=\"https://www.banrep.gov.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">banrep.gov.co<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "The Bank of the Republic",
      "eyebrow": "Error de Corte Descentrado · Bogotá, Colombia · 2005 y 2009"
